{"title":"Jer's Junkyard","slug":"Jer's_Junkyard","pageid":655,"revid":19646,"timestamp":"2025-09-27T06:57:35Z","lastEditor":"Sjsbjsbsiabakoa","categories":["Removed","Locations"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"NPC","value":"Jer Junkman, Jerry Junkman"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Selling resources, buying miscellaneous items"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"Unknown"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"Unknown"},{"label":"Status","value":"On the Map"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p><span>Removed</span><br>\n<span><i>The following content has been removed from the game or does not exist.</i></span></p>\n<div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Jer's Junkyard is a junkyard located northeast of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>. It consists of two small buildings, a sell zone, and mounds of junk. The area is encircled by a chain link fence.\n</p><p>You can speak to Jer Junkman to sell all of your resources within the sell zone. You can speak to Jerry Junkman to buy items from the building with the \"Jerry's Junk\" sign in the junkyard.\n</p><p><b>Selling metallic resources</b> to Jer's Junkyard will sell for <b>10%</b> <b>more</b> money than if you were to sell the ores to other sell points such as at The Oak Depot.\n</p><p><b>Selling wooden</b> <b>resources</b> to Jer's Junkyard will sell for <b>10% less</b> money than if you were to sell the wood to other sell points. \n</p><p>Jer's Junkyard has since been replaced by the Resource Hub, which pays full price for all resources. \n</p><p>In the new map, you can see Jer's Junkyard being way more destroyed. \n</p>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<p>This table will show all items available at Jerry's Junk.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"items\">Items</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Grabby_Grabber/\">Grabby Grabber</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Grabby-Grabber-BOXED\">Grabby-Grabber-BOXED</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$22,569\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Rusty_Putter/\">Rusty Putter</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Rusty-Putter-BOXED\">Rusty-Putter-BOXED</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$49\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Spare_Tire/\">Spare Tire</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Spare Tire\">Spare Tire</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$280\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Jar/\">Jar</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Empty Jar\">Empty Jar</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$2,008\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Refined_Axe/\">Tall Refined Axe</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Tallrefinedaxebox\">Tallrefinedaxebox</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$16,136\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Trolley/\">Trolley</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Image 2023-07-18 072211190\">Image 2023-07-18 072211190</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$1,400\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Small_Crate/\">Small Crate</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Small Crate\">Small Crate</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Medium_Crate/\">Medium Crate</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span r